      "text": "• <pkg>/ : conanfile.py + conandata.yml + src/*.tar.gz + patches/\n• extensions/deployers/legacy_nupkg.py\n• profiles/  (lin-gcc84-x86_64, lin-gcc75-arm-linaro, win-*)\n• test-astra/*.sh  ↔  test-windows/*.bat   (+ HELP.txt)",
